{
  "packName": "SAF420_v19",
  "description": "SAF420 commuter EMU - control car A / control car B / trailer",
  "outputDir": "${MC_ROOT}/mmtr/game/fabric/run/resourcepacks",
  "packFormat": 18,
  "cars": [
    {
      "id": "saf420cab_a",
      "name": "SAF420 控制车（A 端）",
      "color": "7FA8CC",
      "transportMode": "TRAIN",
      "carLengthBlocks": 19.5,
      "carWidthBlocks": 2.95,
      "bogieCount": 2,
      "bogieOffsetBlocks": -6.625,
      "bogie2OffsetBlocks": 6.625,
      "couplingPadding1": 0.525,
      "couplingPadding2": 0.525,
      "sourceObj": "${MC_ROOT}/assets/models/blender/saf420cab/saf420cab.obj",
      "textureDir": "${MC_ROOT}/assets/models/blender/saf420cab",
      "rotationDegY": 180,
      "_orientationNote": "A 端车必须 rotationDegY=180 **且不改名**：模型作者的驾驶室1在 -Z，而锚点 JSON 是文件空间、客户端用 (x,y,z)->(-x,y,-z) 转骑乘空间，engineEndOfSeat 又按骑乘空间 z 判端 —— 所以【文件 z>0 = cab1 = 引擎 A 端】。rotation 0 会把 cab1 送到引擎 B 端（整列车头尾朝向反过来，2026-09-28 实机遇到的就是这个）。B 端车是 rotation 0 + _1->_2 改名。判据：mmtr/tools/anchor-check/verify_lights.js 的 L4。",
      "_recenterNote": "false：模型本来就以【车体中心】为原点（z ±9.75 / x ±1.475）。车头清障铲与自动车钩必然伸出端面，若仍 recenter:true，打包器按旋转后包围盒中心平移会把整节车多挪 0.19 m（实测），车钩会连着转向架、门、锚点一起偏。",
      "recenter": false,
      "flipTextureV": true,
      "untexturedUv": [0.5, 0.5],
      "_interiorRenderStageNote": "内装走 INTERIOR（不透明 CUTOUT_BRIGHT，全亮），与 MTR 官方车一致；窗户是真正的洞 + 单独的 glass 部件（半透明）。默认的 INTERIOR_TRANSLUCENT 会把座椅/墙板当半透明件画（底层 getEntityTranslucentCull 有背面剔除），实测从车外看不到内装、从车内看像破面（notes/345 §7.11）。",
      "interiorRenderStage": "INTERIOR",
      "groupMap": {
        "body": ["cab_body", "bogies", "plow", "coupler", "underbox", "roof_ac", "dest_board"],
        "interior": ["interior"],
        "door_l": ["door_l"],
        "door_r": ["door_r"],
        "anchor": ["mmtr_"],
        "headlights": ["headlights"],
        "glass": ["glass"]
      },
      "_glassNote": "玻璃在模型里是【独立对象】glass ⇒ 独立部件，所以能带自己的一套材质/贴图（interior_translucent + saf420_glass.png）与自己的 renderStage。**不要**退回成【在 interior 组内部换材质】：实测那样整个 interior 会按玻璃贴图画，从车外看不见内装（notes/345 §7.9）。",
      "_lightNote": "车灯必须是独立组：一个组只能有一个 renderStage。condition 管【画不画】，renderStage 管【发不发光】（ALWAYS_ON_LIGHT = 恒亮、不吃世界光也不吃方向光）。当前只有白前照灯；红尾灯（tail_lights / LAMP_R 灯罩格）已删，加回来 = 模型里重建该组 + 这里补一条 groupMap 与两条 part（倒行 + 在段）。",
      "_lightAnchorNote": "车灯的【光源】是锚点、不是这个可见组：模型里另有 mmtr_light_<驾驶室>_<第几盏> 的独立四边形（面中心=灯罩中心，面法线=射出方向，必须朝车外）。cab 1 = A 端（-Z，与 mmtr_hud_1 / mmtr_windshield_1_1 同一个约定）。实测车头是左右两盏一样的 0.26 m 方块灯（x=±1.020, y=1.580, 外表面 z=-9.780），所以编号只是序号、【强度按灯罩面积算】—— 不是【1=主灯 2=标志灯】。锚点的面被剥掉、不进渲染几何，只进 mmtr_anchors_<id>.json。判据与规则见 notes/345，离线自检 mmtr/tools/anchor-check/verify_lights.js。",
      "partSpecs": {
        "headlights": [
          {"renderStage": "ALWAYS_ON_LIGHT", "condition": "ON_ROUTE_FORWARDS"}
        ],
        "glass": [
          {"renderStage": "INTERIOR_TRANSLUCENT"}
        ]
      },
      "doorAnimationType": "STANDARD",
      "doorSlidePx": 14,
      "_doorSlideNote": "TWO leaves per doorway: the packager's default is ONE sign for the whole side (door_l* +, door_r* -), which sends one leaf of every pair INTO its own opening. These per-leaf signs send each leaf AWAY from its doorway centre - check with mmtr/tools/anchor-check/verify_doors.js.",
      "doorSlideByGroup": {
        "door_l_1": -14, "door_l_2": 14, "door_l_3": -14, "door_l_4": 14, "door_l_5": -14, "door_l_6": 14,
        "door_r_1": -14, "door_r_2": 14, "door_r_3": -14, "door_r_4": 14, "door_r_5": -14, "door_r_6": 14
      },
      "extraDoorways": ["cabdoor_1_1", "cabdoor_1_2"]
    },
    {
      "id": "saf420cab_b",
      "name": "SAF420 控制车（B 端）",
      "color": "7FA8CC",
      "transportMode": "TRAIN",
      "carLengthBlocks": 19.5,
      "carWidthBlocks": 2.95,
      "bogieCount": 2,
      "bogieOffsetBlocks": -6.625,
      "bogie2OffsetBlocks": 6.625,
      "couplingPadding1": 0.525,
      "couplingPadding2": 0.525,
      "sourceObj": "${MC_ROOT}/assets/models/blender/saf420cab/saf420cab.obj",
      "textureDir": "${MC_ROOT}/assets/models/blender/saf420cab",
      "rotationDegY": 0,
      "_orientationNote": "B 端车 = rotationDegY 0 + 下面的 groupRename 把 _1 改写成 _2，两者必须成对：rotation 0 让作者的驾驶室1 落在文件 z<0（= 骑乘 z>0 = 引擎 B 端），改名让它自称 cab2。只改一个 = 整列车头尾朝向反过来（见 saf420cab_a 的 _orientationNote）。",
      "recenter": false,
      "flipTextureV": true,
      "untexturedUv": [0.5, 0.5],
      "_interiorRenderStageNote": "内装走 INTERIOR（不透明 CUTOUT_BRIGHT，全亮），与 MTR 官方车一致；窗户是真正的洞 + 单独的 glass 部件（半透明）。默认的 INTERIOR_TRANSLUCENT 会把座椅/墙板当半透明件画（底层 getEntityTranslucentCull 有背面剔除），实测从车外看不到内装、从车内看像破面（notes/345 §7.11）。",
      "interiorRenderStage": "INTERIOR",
      "groupMap": {
        "body": ["cab_body", "bogies", "plow", "coupler", "underbox", "roof_ac", "dest_board"],
        "interior": ["interior"],
        "door_l": ["door_l"],
        "door_r": ["door_r"],
        "anchor": ["mmtr_"],
        "headlights": ["headlights"],
        "glass": ["glass"]
      },
      "_glassNote": "玻璃在模型里是【独立对象】glass ⇒ 独立部件，所以能带自己的一套材质/贴图（interior_translucent + saf420_glass.png）与自己的 renderStage。**不要**退回成【在 interior 组内部换材质】：实测那样整个 interior 会按玻璃贴图画，从车外看不见内装（notes/345 §7.9）。",
      "_lightNote": "B 端控制车：整车由 rotationDegY 180 烘到另一端。**可见灯组**（headlights）不用改名 —— 几何跟着旋转走；但 **mmtr_light_* 锚点必须改名**（_1 -> _2，见下面 groupRename），否则 B 车的灯锚点会自称【驾驶室1】却长在车体另一端 —— 与 hud/seat/cabdoor/windshield 是同一条规则。用通配符一条覆盖任意数量的灯，避免【下次再加一盏就漏了】。当前只有白前照灯。",
      "partSpecs": {
        "headlights": [
          {"renderStage": "ALWAYS_ON_LIGHT", "condition": "ON_ROUTE_FORWARDS"}
        ],
        "glass": [
          {"renderStage": "INTERIOR_TRANSLUCENT"}
        ]
      },
      "groupRename": {
        "mmtr_hud_1": "mmtr_hud_2",
        "mmtr_seat_1": "mmtr_seat_2",
        "mmtr_cabdoor_1_1": "mmtr_cabdoor_2_1",
        "mmtr_cabdoor_1_2": "mmtr_cabdoor_2_2",
        "mmtr_windshield_1_1": "mmtr_windshield_2_1",
        "mmtr_wipersweep_1_1": "mmtr_wipersweep_2_1",
        "mmtr_wipersweep_1_1_2": "mmtr_wipersweep_2_1_2",
        "mmtr_light_1_*": "mmtr_light_2_*",
        "wiper_1_1": "wiper_2_1",
        "wiper_1_1_2": "wiper_2_1_2",
        "wiperarm_1_1": "wiperarm_2_1",
        "wiperarm_1_1_2": "wiperarm_2_1_2"
      },
      "doorAnimationType": "STANDARD",
      "doorSlidePx": 14,
      "_doorSlideNote": "The reversed car: rotationDegY bakes the vertices, so the SAME leaf names now sit mirrored in z and every sign is the forward car's NEGATED (verify_doors.js decides it from the packed geometry, not from this note).",
      "doorSlideByGroup": {
        "door_l_1": 14, "door_l_2": -14, "door_l_3": 14, "door_l_4": -14, "door_l_5": 14, "door_l_6": -14,
        "door_r_1": 14, "door_r_2": -14, "door_r_3": 14, "door_r_4": -14, "door_r_5": 14, "door_r_6": -14
      },
      "extraDoorways": ["cabdoor_2_1", "cabdoor_2_2"]
    },
    {
      "id": "saf420car",
      "name": "SAF420 拖车",
      "color": "7FA8CC",
      "transportMode": "TRAIN",
      "carLengthBlocks": 16.95,
      "carWidthBlocks": 2.95,
      "bogieCount": 2,
      "bogieOffsetBlocks": -5.5,
      "bogie2OffsetBlocks": 5.5,
      "couplingPadding1": 0.525,
      "couplingPadding2": 0.525,
      "sourceObj": "${MC_ROOT}/assets/models/blender/saf420car/saf420car.obj",
      "textureDir": "${MC_ROOT}/assets/models/blender/saf420car",
      "rotationDegY": 180,
      "recenter": true,
      "flipTextureV": true,
      "untexturedUv": [0.5, 0.5],
      "groupMap": {
        "body": ["cab_body", "bogies"],
        "interior": ["interior"],
        "door_l": ["door_l"],
        "door_r": ["door_r"]
      },
      "doorAnimationType": "STANDARD",
      "doorSlidePx": 14,
      "_doorSlideNote": "Same two-leaves-per-doorway fix as the control car (this body shares its door layout).",
      "doorSlideByGroup": {
        "door_l_1": -14, "door_l_2": 14, "door_l_3": -14, "door_l_4": 14, "door_l_5": -14, "door_l_6": 14,
        "door_r_1": -14, "door_r_2": 14, "door_r_3": -14, "door_r_4": 14, "door_r_5": -14, "door_r_6": 14
      }
    }
  ]
}

